	 ('cdde3893-8dc8-4b7b-a70e-3286fd155a4b'::uuid,'01990b81-e3f7-7278-9efc-6bde7f31552b'::uuid,'The Blue Slaad can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature''s turn. The Blue Slaad regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn. Detect. The Blue Slaad makes a Wisdom (Perception) check. Teleport. The Blue Slaad magically teleports, along with any equipment it is wearing or carrying, up to 120 feet to an unoccupied space it can see.','Actions',false,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('fd523e1d-3aa6-4c44-9dca-c046018a28f6'::uuid,'01990b81-fa5c-76ef-ab6d-78c02d7160d5'::uuid,'Bloodied Fury. While Bloodied, the boar has Advantage on attack rolls.','Bloodied Fury',false,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Bloodied',NULL,'While Bloodied'),
	 ('04517529-70ac-4870-b46e-3d586c3a479f'::uuid,'01990b82-1b34-7f2d-921a-c00875c4f558'::uuid,'Magic Resistance. The devil has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.','Magic Resistance',false,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('d1be9af2-f9f1-4753-b93f-14400f54c55f'::uuid,'01990b82-1b34-7f2d-921a-c00875c4f558'::uuid,'Diabolical Restoration. If the devil dies outside the Nine Hells, its body disappears in sulfurous smoke, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Nine Hells.','Diabolical Restoration',false,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
	 ('4114e7af-6a65-4451-b367-bacedf5c6c83'::uuid,'01990b82-5265-7740-9f5d-9b24c2e84c2f'::uuid,'The brazen gorgon makes two attacks: one with its gore and one with its hooves. Alternatively, it uses its Petrifying Gaze.','Actions',false,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
